      "category": "overview",
      "field": "programme_description",
      "value": "The Bachelor of Arts program in social and cultural analysis with a concentration in women and gender studies offers you a transdisciplinary curriculum that focuses on the diverse experiences of women in national and international contexts. You also examine the meaning of gender as a socially constructed category that shapes personal identities, beliefs, opportunities and behaviors.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": null,
